IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q04-MIN-BAL-FEE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BALANCE         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MIN-BAL         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-FEE             PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-NEW-BAL         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-BAL        PIC Z(8)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-BALANCE
ACCEPT WS-MIN-BAL
ACCEPT WS-FEE
IF WS-BALANCE < WS-MIN-BAL
    IF WS-BALANCE >= WS-FEE
        COMPUTE WS-NEW-BAL = WS-BALANCE - WS-FEE
        MOVE WS-NEW-BAL TO WS-DISP-BAL
        DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-BAL)
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "FEE CANNOT BE COLLECTED"
    END-IF
ELSE
    MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-DISP-BAL
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-BAL)
END-IF
STOP RUN.
